				<spell>
						<name>Shadow Trap</name>
						<outputname>Shadow Trap</outputname>
						<times_memorized>1</times_memorized>
						<range>Close (35 ft.)</range>
						<components>V,S</components>
						<castingtime>1 standard action</castingtime>
						<casterlevel>5</casterlevel>
						<concentration>+9</concentration>
						<dc>15</dc>
						<duration>5 rounds</duration>
						<effect>You pin the target&#39;s shadow to its current location, causing the target to become entangled and preventing it from moving farther than 5 feet from its original position, as if its shadow were anchored to the terrain. Each round on its turn, the target can attempt a new saving throw to end the effect as a full-round action. A flying creature can only hover in place or fall while entangled in this manner. This spell automatically fails when cast on a creature that doesn&#39;t throw a shadow, and it ends if the creature is entirely in an area with no illumination.</effect>
						<target>One creature</target>
						<saveinfo>Will negates</saveinfo>
						<school>
							<school>Illusion</school>
							<subschool>Shadow</subschool>
							<descriptor></descriptor>
							<fullschool>Illusion (Shadow)</fullschool>
						</school>
						<source>
							<source>Paizo Inc. - Pathfinder Player Companion: Blood of Shadows, p.31</source>
							<sourcelevel>Clr1</sourcelevel>
							<sourcelink></sourcelink>
							<sourcepage>p.31</sourcepage>
							<sourceshort>BOS</sourceshort>
						</source>
						<spell_resistance>Yes</spell_resistance>
						<description>You pin the target&#39;s shadow to its current location, causing the target to become entangled and preventing it from moving farther than 5 feet from its original position, as if its shadow were anchored to the terrain. Each round on its turn, the target can attempt a new saving throw to end the effect as a full-round action. A flying creature can only hover in place or fall while entangled in this manner. This spell automatically fails when cast on a creature that doesn&#39;t throw a shadow, and it ends if the creature is entirely in an area with no illumination.</description>
						<bonusspell></bonusspell>
				</spell>
				<spell>
						<name>Shield of Faith</name>
						<outputname>Shield of Faith</outputname>
						<times_memorized>1</times_memorized>
						<range>Touch</range>
						<components>V, S, M</components>
						<castingtime>1 standard action</castingtime>
