						<casterlevel>5</casterlevel>
						<concentration>+9</concentration>
						<dc>15</dc>
						<duration>5 rounds [see text]</duration>
						<effect>A touch from your hand, which is engulfed in darkness, disrupts a creature&#39;s vision by coating its eyes in supernatural darkness. Each touch causes the target to become blinded for 1 round unless it makes a successful Fortitude saving throw. You can use this melee touch attack up to 5 times. Any touch attack not used after 5 rounds is lost.</effect>
