						<dc>16</dc>
						<duration>Instantaneous</duration>
						<effect>You transform one bottle of fine wine into 1 pint of animal blood, sufficient for a creature with the blood drain ability to feed upon as if it came from a Medium animal with 1 Hit Die.</effect>
