						<dc>17</dc>
						<duration>5 minutes</duration>
						<effect>When casting this spell, choose a single skill that you have at least one rank in. The target gains a +3 insight bonus on skill checks with this skill and is considered trained in that skill. Furthermore, once before the spell&#39;s duration, the target can choose to roll two checks and take the greater result. Doing so ends the spell&#39;s other effects.</effect>
