				<spell>
						<name>Life Shield</name>
						<outputname>Life Shield</outputname>
						<times_memorized>1</times_memorized>
						<range>Personal</range>
						<components>S,DF</components>
						<castingtime>1 standard action</castingtime>
						<casterlevel>5</casterlevel>
						<concentration>+9</concentration>
						<dc></dc>
						<duration>5 minutes or until discharged</duration>
						<effect>You surround yourself with a positive energy field that damages undead opponents. Each time an undead creature damages you with a melee attack, that creature takes an amount of positive energy damage equal to half the damage it dealt to you. This damage is calculated after applying your damage reduction, resistances, and other defenses. Once this spell has dealt 0 points of damage, it is discharged.</effect>
						<target>You</target>
						<saveinfo></saveinfo>
						<school>
							<school>Conjuration</school>
							<subschool>Healing</subschool>
							<descriptor></descriptor>
							<fullschool>Conjuration (Healing)</fullschool>
						</school>
						<source>
							<source>Paizo Inc. - Pathfinder Player Companion: Undead Slayer&#39;s Handbook, p.27</source>
							<sourcelevel>Clr3</sourcelevel>
							<sourcelink></sourcelink>
							<sourcepage>p.27</sourcepage>
							<sourceshort>USH</sourceshort>
						</source>
						<spell_resistance></spell_resistance>
						<description>You surround yourself with a positive energy field that damages undead opponents. Each time an undead creature damages you with a melee attack, that creature takes an amount of positive energy damage equal to half the damage it dealt to you. This damage is calculated after applying your damage reduction, resistances, and other defenses. Once this spell has dealt 0 points of damage, it is discharged.</description>
						<bonusspell></bonusspell>
				</spell>
				<spell>
						<name>Light of Iomedae</name>
						<outputname>Light of Iomedae</outputname>
						<times_memorized>1</times_memorized>
						<range>Medium (150 ft.)</range>
						<components>V, S, DF</components>
						<castingtime>1 minute</castingtime>
						<casterlevel>5</casterlevel>
						<concentration>+9</concentration>
						<dc>17</dc>
						<duration>5 minutes</duration>
						<effect><para>With this spell, you create shafts of blue light that illuminate all undead creatures in the area. Affected undead take a -20 penalty on all Stealth checks. Invisible undead are not made visible by this effect, but the light does make it easy to pinpoint the exact squares in which such undead are located [they still retain the 50% miss chance granted by invisibility]. The light of Iomedae increases light levels by one step in a 5-foot radius around an affected undead creature. Once an undead is affected, it remains illuminated as long as remains within the spell&#39;s range, even if it leaves the spell&#39;s original radius, until the spell&#39;s duration ends. </para><para>Affected undead must also make a Will save when they are first illuminated by the light of Iomedae. Those who fail this save lose all benefits of channel resistance and take a -2 penalty on all saving throws made against positive energy effects.</para></effect>
						<target>All undead in a 10-foot-radius spread</target>
						<saveinfo>Will partial</saveinfo>
						<school>
							<school>Conjuration</school>
							<subschool></subschool>
							<descriptor>Good, Light</descriptor>
							<fullschool>Conjuration [Good, Light]</fullschool>
						</school>
						<source>
							<source>Paizo Publishing - Inner Sea Magic, p.58</source>
							<sourcelevel>Clr3</sourcelevel>
							<sourcelink></sourcelink>
							<sourcepage>p.58</sourcepage>
							<sourceshort>ISM</sourceshort>
						</source>
						<spell_resistance>Yes</spell_resistance>
						<description><para>With this spell, you create shafts of blue light that illuminate all undead creatures in the area. Affected undead take a -20 penalty on all Stealth checks. Invisible undead are not made visible by this effect, but the light does make it easy to pinpoint the exact squares in which such undead are located (they still retain the 50% miss chance granted by invisibility). The light of Iomedae increases light levels by one step in a 5-foot radius around an affected undead creature. Once an undead is affected, it remains illuminated as long as remains within the spell&#39;s range, even if it leaves the spell&#39;s original radius, until the spell&#39;s duration ends. </para><para>Affected undead must also make a Will save when they are first illuminated by the light of Iomedae. Those who fail this save lose all benefits of channel resistance and take a -2 penalty on all saving throws made against positive energy effects.</para></description>
						<bonusspell></bonusspell>
				</spell>
				<spell>
						<name>Locate Object</name>
						<outputname>Locate Object</outputname>
